+
+At `n<=100`, Kmin=2 gives 658 core rows, 20 operative rows, and 17 after original Xu. The exact all-degree replay took about 36 seconds for the core/tree/Xu comparison and has **zero full-tree implementation mismatches**. Individual rows and both bounds are in [op-ft-xu-count.json](../box/census-coverage-20260905/op-ft-xu-count.json). A count of 1,420 for the conjunction would be a population-label error, not a coverage leak: it describes a larger, still safe necessary-condition residue.
+
+**The containment proof closes the requested foundation obligation.** Start with a minimal non-coordinate Keller pair and apply the licensed normalizations and promoted First-Separation lemma. The table of A conditions applies without a degree cap. The explicit loop argument places each of its major-tower rows in the core. The actual factor tree supplies the operative integer partitions; every actual major successor extends and satisfies the terminal equation. Its centre cannot follow a prohibited removable path by Prop.5.6 and the packet argument. Its local ODE forbids every rejected degenerate multiplicity. Finally its actual Xu intersection data lie between the computed bounds. Therefore neither the core nor the original operative conjunction can discard that row. Restricting the normalized degree to `n<=200` yields the finite coverage theorem claimed at the beginning.
+
+The literal p.201 item (4) remains defective wording, but is replaced by a named printed theorem, so it leaves no undecidable implemented restriction. Neither B clause leaks into the code. The 343 low-K extras and 1,833 height-six rows are fully enumerated diagnostics, not counts of realized counterexamples. No repaired enumerator is mathematically required; the charged source was left unchanged. The necessary repair is to its description: **all-degree consequences of the search list, with explicit normalizations and GGV**, not “(1)–(13) implemented verbatim”; and **1,420 before Xu / 1,377 after original Xu**. An unrestricted choice `Kmin>16`, an extra height-five cutoff, or importing UNI/H2 as unconditional would require a new coverage audit.
+
+**FALLACY-v2 and reproducibility.** Printed search normalization was separated from theorem at the exact p.200–201 lines above. Every normalization names a source/target automorphism. The Puiseux action distinguishes the old lattice, branch coefficient, and entire physical packet. Major upper bounds and minor floors are never turned into attainment; a numerical row is never called a realized pair. The parent's `V_{s+1}=d_{s+1}` is not transported to a child. No new exit-price assertion is made, so no charge-basis declaration applies.
